*> vybe-test: cobol/programs/bubble_sort
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_programs.rs

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BSORT.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TABLE.
   05 WS-NUM PIC 9(5) OCCURS 5 TIMES.
01 WS-I    PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-J    PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-TEMP PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-SIZE PIC 9(3) VALUE 5.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 50 TO WS-NUM(1).
    MOVE 30 TO WS-NUM(2).
    MOVE 10 TO WS-NUM(3).
    MOVE 40 TO WS-NUM(4).
    MOVE 20 TO WS-NUM(5).
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I >= WS-SIZE
        PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-J >= WS-SIZE
            IF WS-NUM(WS-J) > WS-NUM(WS-J + 1)
                MOVE WS-NUM(WS-J) TO WS-TEMP
                MOVE WS-NUM(WS-J + 1) TO WS-NUM(WS-J)
                MOVE WS-TEMP TO WS-NUM(WS-J + 1)
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > WS-SIZE
        DISPLAY WS-NUM(WS-I)
    END-PERFORM.
    STOP RUN.

